  "description": "FAPPOC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C158 H241 Nd3 O12,C14 H22 O1. From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.719-3.771 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.09-104.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Nd3(OC6H3But2-3,5)9(HOC6H3But2-3,5)2(thf)]·HOC6H3But2-3,5.",
